  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.54 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Voluntary Certification of Community Health Workers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.54 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Voluntary Certification of Community Health Workers. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.54, below, shall apply to the voluntary certification of community health workers under RSA 326-N:\n\nTable 1002.54 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Voluntary Certification of Community Health Workers\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nVoluntary certification application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of certification | 2 years | $160\n\nSource. #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
